docs/plans/2026-06-17-003-fix-twofield-compliant-density-projection-plan.md:214:- **Legacy `∇·v=0` divergence-decay gate trips under the uncapped target (most likely L0 regression).** The uncapped target intentionally leaves nonzero post-projection `∇·v` while correcting density (the rhs is a divergence *target*), but `u3_rerun_divergence_decay_mid_jet` asserts `∇·v < DIV_TOL=0.3`. Mitigation: KTD7 (committed) — re-point the gate to assert density-error / pressure-residual decay; never loosen `DIV_TOL`.
